{
  "about": "Placeholder bench rows for scripts/dot-bench.py (gate rows 1-14 and 19-22). {base} is the bench server URL, {host} its host:port, {bench_dir} the scratch folder /tmp/dot-bench. Calendar and mail rows (15-18) are generated privately at run time and never committed.",
